Remove hard-coded review workaround for gitlabduo reviewer

- this would circumvent repo-level approval requirements, like minimum number of reviewers or DC reviewers

- add review.non_approvers config to indicate reviewers that cannot (or do not need to) approve

- do not add non-approvers to review rules

- do not require non-approvers to approve for publish

